WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.800
Overdue invoices don't chase themselves.

00:04.800 --> 00:09.800
They slip while you are doing the work that actually pays. Reminders sent: zero.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.500
One workflow. Three tones.

00:15.500 --> 00:21.800
Tone is computed in code: friendly under 14 days, firm to 30, solution-oriented after.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
The draft is ready. You send it.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.500
A 7-day cooldown stops duplicate chasing. Nothing sends itself.
